# Internal working material: the decision record, the planning annex, and
# anything else forward-looking. This repository is public, so nothing here
# ships. SPEC.md at the root is the contract; if something in docs/ starts to
# bind an implementer, it belongs in SPEC.md instead.
docs/

# Agent and editor instruction files. Local tooling configuration, not repository
# content. The durable engineering standards live in docs/REVIEW.md.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
